<!--
  Status-bar icon for due-date reminders.

  Android draws a notification's small icon as a monochrome mask: it keeps only
  the alpha channel and tints the result. The launcher icon (which the receiver
  used before) is a full-colour bitmap, so it came out as a solid white blob.
  This is the same glyph family Material uses for "check circle", in white.
-->
